{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And the woman saw that the tree was good for food.</b> She perceived that it was pleasant to eat on account of the nature of the place, its atmosphere, and the fragrance of the fruit." "<b>And that the tree was desirable to make wise.</b> For the blessed El had already said that it is the tree of knowledge." "<b>She gave also to her husband with her.</b> His heart was persuaded by her words because she was his wife, and because he was with her."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:49.817140967Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}